<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou again?\rRelax.\nI don’t waste time on scrubs.\rSpeakin’ of weak, the city’s\nBlock Boss ain’t here, and\fsupposedly she babysittin’ a\fsick homie at the Lighthouse.\rHmph! Boo-hoo!\nJust let sick homies go!\rA homie that can’t scrap\nis worthless!\rWhy don’t you go train at\nthe Lighthouse?\rWho knows? It might make you a lil\nbetter of a Hustler!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dark roads dangerous at night.\rBut a pitch-black night on the SEA?\nWorse. Way worse.\rWithout the Lighthouse, no boat sail.\nThat Lighthouse carryin’ this whole\feconomy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That thing you got--a Pokégear,\nright? Sheesh, that’s hard.\rI still got a flip phone. It flip.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you got a HOMIE!\nThat’s so hard. I got a goldfish.\fHe don’t scrap.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You, young Hustler!\nThe SEA is SWEET!\rSING WITH ME!\fTHE SEA IS BLUE!\nTHE SEA IS SALTY! LIKE ME!\fLIKE MY DIVORCE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine City\nThe Port. Smells Like Fish.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine Port\nFast-Ship Pier</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine City Block\nBoss: Jasmine\fThe Steel-Clad Defense Girl</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0604_T26_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Olivine’s Lighthouse\rThey Call It\nthe Glitter Lighthouse.</language>
	</row>
</body>
